      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have some more info here about which VRC versions trigger the crash and which were fine.\n\nBefore 2023.3.3 initial release:\n\n- Stable: no crash\n\n- Beta: crash\n\n(Unity 2022 beta was already crashing several weeks ago when I first tried, but couldn't put a finger on why)\n\nAfter 2023.3.3 initial release:\n\n- Stable: crash\n\n- Beta: crash\n\nAfter rollback:\n\n- Stable: no crash\n\n- Beta: crash\n\nAfter 2023.3.3p1 re-release\n\n- Stable: crash\n\n- Beta: crash",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
